      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ESTRADA (5) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors four starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (17.71) at this track over 300m. The form out of last race has been strong. Overdue and gets her chance. CAPPADORA (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 17.42 beating Spider Hulk. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. One of the leading chances again. SPEEDY DEVILLE (1) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 300m behind Zatara's Image (17.65) in a Free For All. Likely to be thereabouts. DIXIE LAD (4) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
